{"id":100123,"slug":"100123-ingest-pipeline-dung-de-lam-gi","category":"Elasticsearch","subcategory":"Indexing","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Ingest pipeline dùng để làm gì?","question_en":"What are ingest pipelines for?","answer_vi":"Biến đổi document **trước khi index**, ngay trong cluster: parse chuỗi, đổi kiểu, thêm field, bỏ field nhạy cảm, làm giàu dữ liệu.\n\n```json\nPUT /_ingest/pipeline/order_pipeline\n{\n  \"processors\": [\n    { \"grok\": { \"field\": \"message\", \"patterns\": [\"%{IP:client_ip}\"] } },\n    { \"date\": { \"field\": \"ts\", \"formats\": [\"ISO8601\"], \"target_field\": \"@timestamp\" } },\n    { \"remove\": { \"field\": [\"card_number\", \"cvv\"] } },\n    { \"set\": { \"field\": \"env\", \"value\": \"prod\" } }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n```bash\nPUT /orders/_doc/1?pipeline=order_pipeline\n```\n\nGiá trị lớn nhất là **không phải sửa producer**: nhiều service ghi vào cùng một index, chuẩn hoá tập trung ở pipeline rẻ hơn nhiều so với đi sửa từng service.\n\nBắt buộc phải test trước khi áp:\n\n```bash\nPOST /_ingest/pipeline/order_pipeline/_simulate\n```\n\nĐánh đổi: pipeline chạy trên ingest node và tốn CPU, `grok` phức tạp có thể thành bottleneck. Với khối lượng lớn, tách ingest node riêng hoặc xử lý ở tầng trước (Logstash, ứng dụng).","answer_en":"Transforming documents **before indexing**, inside the cluster: parsing strings, converting types, adding fields, dropping sensitive ones, enriching data.\n\n```json\nPUT /_ingest/pipeline/order_pipeline\n{\n  \"processors\": [\n    { \"grok\": { \"field\": \"message\", \"patterns\": [\"%{IP:client_ip}\"] } },\n    { \"date\": { \"field\": \"ts\", \"formats\": [\"ISO8601\"], \"target_field\": \"@timestamp\" } },\n    { \"remove\": { \"field\": [\"card_number\", \"cvv\"] } },\n    { \"set\": { \"field\": \"env\", \"value\": \"prod\" } }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n```bash\nPUT /orders/_doc/1?pipeline=order_pipeline\n```\n\nThe biggest value is **not having to change producers**: when many services write to one index, normalizing centrally in a pipeline is far cheaper than editing each service.\n\nAlways simulate before applying:\n\n```bash\nPOST /_ingest/pipeline/order_pipeline/_simulate\n```\n\nThe trade-off: pipelines run on ingest nodes and cost CPU, and complex `grok` can become a bottleneck. At high volume, dedicate ingest nodes or move the work upstream (Logstash, the application).","answer_html_vi":"<p>Biến đổi document <strong>trước khi index</strong>, ngay trong cluster: parse chuỗi, đổi kiểu, thêm field, bỏ field nhạy cảm, làm giàu dữ liệu.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">json</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"PUT /_ingest/pipeline/order_pipeline\n{\n  &quot;processors&quot;: [\n    { &quot;grok&quot;: { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;message&quot;, &quot;patterns&quot;: [&quot;%{IP:client_ip}&quot;] } },\n    { &quot;date&quot;: { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;ts&quot;, &quot;formats&quot;: [&quot;ISO8601&quot;], &quot;target_field&quot;: &quot;@timestamp&quot; } },\n    { &quot;remove&quot;: { &quot;field&quot;: [&quot;card_number&quot;, &quot;cvv&quot;] } },\n    { &quot;set&quot;: { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;env&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: &quot;prod&quot; } }\n  ]\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">PUT /_ingest/pipeline/order_pipeline\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;processors&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;grok&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;field&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;message&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;patterns&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;%{IP:client_ip}&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;date&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;field&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;ts&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;formats&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;ISO8601&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;target_field&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;@timestamp&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;remove&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;field&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;card_number&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;cvv&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;set&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;field&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;env&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;value&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;prod&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"PUT /orders/_doc/1?pipeline=order_pipeline\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" strok