ne is far cheaper than editing each service.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Always simulate before applying:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"POST /_ingest/pipeline/order_pipeline/_simulate\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">POST /_ingest/pipeline/order_pipeline/_simulate</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">The trade-off: pipelines run on ingest nodes and cost CPU, and complex <code>grok</code> can become a bottleneck.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">At high volume, dedicate ingest nodes or move the work upstream (Logstash, the application).</p>","references":[{"label":"Elastic — Ingest pipelines","url":"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/ingest.html"},{"label":"Elastic — Bulk API","url":"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/docs-bulk.html"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/100106-index-xong-mot-document-nhung-search-ngay-khong-thay-vi-sao","title":"Index xong một document nhưng search ngay không thấy. Vì sao?"},{"url":"/q/100116-nap-vai-trieu-record-vao-elasticsearch-nen-toi-uu-the-nao","title":"Nạp vài triệu record vào Elasticsearch nên tối ưu thế nào?"},{"ur